{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A new kind of fantasy RPG where you fight with slots!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982350/extras/36054e452d096220b341744b3635c2c0.poster.avif?t=1765982691\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982350/extras/36054e452d096220b341744b3635c2c0.webm?t=1765982691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982350/extras/36054e452d096220b341744b3635c2c0.mp4?t=1765982691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stage is a vast fantasy world where heroes embark on their journey.   <br>At every step of exploration awaits battles with enemies, moments of rest, training, and sometimes eerie, unexpected happenings...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982350/extras/e366d76b4532afaa4b2c98d241470dec.avif?t=1765982691\" width=1560 height=874 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982350/extras/9e1a8dba56445cf7f08d877ccefbcce5.poster.avif?t=1765982691\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982350/extras/9e1a8dba56445cf7f08d877ccefbcce5.webm?t=1765982691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982350/extras/9e1a8dba56445cf7f08d877ccefbcce5.mp4?t=1765982691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Slot Heroes: Reels of Fate</i> is an adventure RPG that turns the results of a <strong>243-payline slot machine into strategy</strong>.  <br>Spin the reels of fate and activate your heroes\u2019 skills according to the outcomes.  <br>By combining three types of skills \u2014 Passive, Active, and Slot \u2014 you can unleash devastating attacks or pull off a dramatic comeback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you entrust yourself to luck, or manipulate the reels to seize victory?   <br>Your choices and the slot results weave the story.   <br>Travel with your companions into the unknown and carve out your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982350/extras/63434e086e599c0c6f8def8837991689.poster.avif?t=1765982691\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982350/extras/63434e086e599c0c6f8def8837991689.webm?t=1765982691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982350/extras/63434e086e599c0c6f8def8837991689.mp4?t=1765982691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83c\udfb0 <strong>Slot-based strategic battles</strong>: 243 paylines that can change the course of combat  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2694\ufe0f <strong>Diverse hero skills</strong>: Combine Passive, Active, and Slot abilities for unique tactics  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83e\uddd9 <strong>Party building</strong>: Assemble heroes with different strengths and create your own strategy  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Exploration and choices</strong>: Encounter enemies, rest, train, and face events \u2014 each step changes your adventure  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udd04 <strong>Replayability</strong>: Every run offers new outcomes and decisions for endless adventure  </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3982350?t=1765982691","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3982350?t=1765982691","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982350/d40735bdb93dcc9cc14b2d448704376625f717a7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765982691","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982350/d40735bdb93dcc9cc14b2d448704376625f717a7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765982691","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4037310,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A new kind of fantasy RPG where you fight with slots!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982350/extras/36054e452d096220b341744b3635c2c0.poster.avif?t=1765982691\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982350/extras/36054e452d096220b341744b3635c2c0.webm?t=1765982691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982350/extras/36054e452d096220b341744b3635c2c0.mp4?t=1765982691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stage is a vast fantasy world where heroes embark on their journey.   <br>At every step of exploration awaits battles with enemi